Dust photo from ALJ-HERDR-WEB-UI, (c) 2026 devswha, MIT
fx/city-dust.webp is brand/city-dust.webp from github.com/alj04ofm-svg/ALJ-HERDR-WEB-UI (commit 227ae3e), unchanged.
fx/city-dust-224.webp is the same photo resized to 224x112 with ImageMagick (Lanczos, webp quality 38, alpha quality
25). The scene also regrades it at build time for each plate's light (scene/backdrop.py dust_uri).

